        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CHAL10, 1 Inch Chalice Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Chalice Cabinet Knob is stunning in its simplicity. It has a very chic design that is highlighted by any of the available finish colors. The 1 Inch Chalice Cabinet Knob features a concave center. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHAL10-specifications.gif?v=1704354649\" width=\"545\" height=\"181\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana CHAL10 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHAL10-installed.jpg?v=1704354649\" width=\"300\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana CHAL10 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the The Chalice Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: .9\"</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHAL10-speifications.pdf?v=1691095332\"><b>Deltana CHAL10 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
